<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">WALU- Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walumi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe na Walumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Walumi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Walumi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cha Walumi yodahika chandikigwa na Msenga Paulo na yodahika chandikigwa mna umulao wa hamsini na nne na mulao wa hamsini na nane kulawa viyavumbuke Kilisito. Paulo kakala hana vika kabisa Loma ivo katuma balua ya malagizo kwa wamtogole Kilisito weli kae ya Loma, wose Wayahudi na haweli Wayahudi. Kandika balua ino viyakalile muikae ya Kolinto, uko kuyakalile mchipindi icho. Paulo kandika balua ino ili Wayahudi na haweli Wayahudi wamtogole na kumtegeleza Yesu Kilisito 16:26.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Walumi ni chitabu chifaya ng'hani kwa wamtogole Kilisito weli chila hanhu na msimo wose kwavija Paulo viyaulongelele bila chifiso ulohozi vichidaha kuupata kubitila Yesu Kilisito. Paulo ivija kolumba hamwe Lagano da mwaka vidiilinga na Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisito. Weli na ilimu wengi wolonga kua msitali ufaya ng'hani mchitabu chino ni 1:16 Ulonga, “Siona chinyala kuligula Usenga Unogile, kwavija ni udaho wa Mulungu uwalohola wanhu wose womtogola, kusongela kwa Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Hanhu ha mosi mchitabu cha Walum (1-12) Yolongelela kwamgati ng'hani kwambuli ya mafundo ga kummanya Mulungu na hanhu hakaidi (13-15) ina malagizo mengi ga vija wamtogole Kilisito viwalondeka kukala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galiumo</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo kasonga balua yake kwa kuitambula iyo mwenyego na kulonga welihi yowandikila muisula 1:1-15</para>
  <para style="io">Amala kandika kwambuli ya wanhu weli na malozo viwali na ulohozi vuudaha kupatika kubitila Yesu Kilisito muisula 1:16-11-36</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo kolava malagizo kwa vija viwalondeka kukala na kusang'hana waja wamtogola Kilisito muisula 12:1-15-13</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo kokomeleza kwandika balua yake kwa Walumi kwa kuwalamusa wanhu wamwenga weli mmabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito uko Lumi muisula 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nie Paulo, mtumigwa wa Kilisito Yesu, na msenga nisaguligwe na kukemigwa na Mulungu kwambuli ya kuligula Usenga Unogile wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Usenga Unogile ulalikigwa kulawa umwaka na Mulungu kubitila walagusi wa Mulungu, kama viyandikigwe Mmayandiko ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Usenga uno Unogile wiza kwambuli ya Mwanage mwenyego, ija yavumbuke kama munhu viyavumbuka, muulelo wa Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />na kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, Mulungu kamlagusa kua Mwana wake haja viyamzilibule. Iyo iyo Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kwa kubitila iyo Yesu Kilisito, Mulungu kaning'ha unovu wake niwe msenga, ili kwambuli yake nidahe kuwalongoza wanhu wa isi zose wadahe kumtogola na kumtegeleza. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Mweye ivija mwaumo mwa waja wakemigwe na Mulungu muwe wanhu wake Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Ivo, nomwandikileni mweye mose mkala uko Loma Mulungu yeli na wende ng'hani na mweye na yamkemileni muwe wanhu wake. Nowapulila unovu wa Mulungu na utindiwala ulawa kwa Mulungu Tata yetu na Mndewa Yesu Kilisito ukale hamwe na mweye.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo komwing'ha hewela Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Mosi, nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu wangu kubitila Yesu Kilisito mlinayo wose, kwavija isi yose ihulika kutogola kwenu. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mulungu ija inimsang'hanila kwa moyo wangu kuligula Usenga Unogile kwambuli ya Mwanage. Mulungu koona na kovimanya kua simsemwani mazua gose hata haja nihapula. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Nompula Mulungu yahalonda mhate nyafasi ya kwiza kuwatembelela.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Chinilonda ng'hani nie kumuonani mweye, nidahe kuwatazeni kwambuli ya kutogola kwenu ili mgangamale. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Chinilonga hano cheye chose nie na mweye chiigele moyo cheye kwa cheye kwa kumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ndugu zangu molondeka mvimanye, mala nyingi nilonda kwiza kuwatembelela mbali kuna mbuli zokanhigiza kusang'hana ivo. Nilonda nione ganogile kulawa kumwenu ivija, kama ganionile kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Nina sang'hano kwa mbuli ya wose, Wayunani na haweli Wayunani, weli na nzewele na walibule nzewele, weli na ilimu na haweli ilimu. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Iyo maana nolonda kuligula Usenga Unogile kwenu mweye mkala uko Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana udaho Muusenga Unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Siona chinyala kuligula Usenga Unogile, kwavija ni udaho wa Mulungu uwalohola wanhu wose womtogola Yesu, kusongela kwa Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwavija Usenga Unogile wolagusa vija Mulungu viyolonda chitogoligwe nayo, mbuli ino yosang'hanika kwakutogola, kulawa haichanduso mbaka hauhelelo, kama viyandikigwe, “Munhu yotogoligwa na Mulungu kokala kwa kulongozigwa na nhogola yake.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubananzi wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ng'hasiliki ya Mulungu iyoneka kweli kulawa kuulanga kwambuli ya wanhu womlema na kutenda ubananzi. Wanhu wao wouhinduka ukweli wake kwa ubananzi wao. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Mulungu kawalamula wose, kwavija gaja galondeke kumanyika kwambuli ya Mulungu gahazelu kumwao, Mulungu mwenyego kageka hazelu. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kulawa Mulungu viyalumbile isi, wanhu wodaha kumanya Mulungu viyeli hata kama haoneka kwa meso. Wanhu wodaha kumanya kua Mulungu kana udaho mazua gose galibule uhelelo na kua iyo Mulungu yaiyeka kwambuli ya vinhu viyalumbile. Baho wanhu hawadaha kulonga kua hawammanyile Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Maza wommanya Mulungu, mbali hawamtegeleza hebu kumwing'ha hewela kama viilondeka. Badili yake, nhonga zao ni ubozi na hawaumanya usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Woigoda wana nzewele, mbali ni wabozi, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />woleka kumfugamila Mulungu yelibule uhelelo, badili yake wofugamila nyang'iti ziigala na wanhu waja wodanganika, hamwe na wanyama na ndege hebu vilumbe vija vitambala.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Kwambuli iyo, Mulungu kawaleka wawinze maya zihile na kuitendela mbuli za chinyala wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Wauleka ukweli wa Mulungu na kuwinza uvwizi, wovifugamila vilumbe na kuvisang'hanila badili ya Mulungu mwenyego yavilumbile, ija yolondeka kwing'higwa nhogolwa ilibule uhelelo! Pepaa.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwaivo, Mulungu kawaleka wawinze maya zao zihile. Hata wanachike wohindula sang'hano za ng'huli zao wowaleka walume woisola wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ivija na walume nao waleka kuwinza nzila inogile ya malumbo ga muke na mulume na woingilila wenyego kwa wenyego. Walume woigela chinyala wenyego, kwaivo wailondela wenyego kulamuligwa hakulu vija viilondeka kwa mbuli zao zihile ziwasang'hana.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwavija wanhu walema kummanya Mulungu, Mulungu kawaleka mzinhonga zao zihile, wasang'hane gaja hagalondeke kusang'hanigwa nao. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Wamema ubananzi wa chila mbuli, luhadu na malozo na maya yakulonda chila chinhu chiwe chao, maya ihile na migongo na ukomaji na ndwagi na uvwizi na kutonga gehile na kuwalongeleza wayao, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />na weli na maligo na womwihila Mulungu, wanhu hawagesa mbuli za wayao weli na zeleu, wanhu weli na magoda na woiona magalu. Wanhu wao mazua gose wolonda nzila ya kusang'hana ubananzi na hawawategeleza tata na mami zao. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Wabozi, hawakomeleza gaja gawalalika na wabule unovu hebu bazi kwa wamwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Wovimanya kua ndagizi ya Mulungu yolonga kua wanhu wosang'hana ivo, wolondeka kudanganika. Chikulu ng'hani sio tu kua wosang'hana gago wao wenyego, mbali wowagweka hata waja wosang'hana gago.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulamuzi wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ivo, mbwiga, kama vuuwalamula wamwenga, hudaha kuigombela ha Mulungu. Kwavija, kwakuwalamula wamwenga vihile, koilamula mwenyego manake gweye ivija kosang'hana gagaja gauwalamula wamwenga. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Chivimanya ulamuzi wa Mulungu kwa waja wosang'hana mbuli kama izo ni ulamuzi uja haumuonela munhu. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Mbali gweye mbwiga uwalamula vihile waja wosang'hana mbuli kama izo kuno gweye kozitenda mbuli izo izo, ivo kogesa kodaha kuubanga ulamuzi wa Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Hebu gweye kouzeleu utendagoya wake mkulu na kufunyamoyo kwake na kukala kwa kugozela kwake, bila kuvimanya kua utendagoya wake wolongoza udahe kuleka malozo na umhindukile Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Mbali gweye kuna udulu na kolema kuleka malozo na kulema kumhindukila Mulungu, kwaivo koikila nyinukila ng'hulu kwa zua dija Mulungu vonda yalaguse ludoko lwake na kulava ulamuzi wake uja haumuonela munhu. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Zua ijo Mulungu komliha chila munhu kuilinga na mbuli ziyatendile. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Mulungu koweng'ha ugima ulibule uhelelo, wanhu waja woiyoha kusang'hana ganogile, kwavija wolonda nhogolwa na kutogoligwa, Mulungu koweng'ha ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Mbali waja wamwenga wailondele mbuli zao wenyego, waja wolema ukweli na kuwinza ubananzi, womtenda Mulungu yagwe ludoko na kuwenukila. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Kokwiza kua na madununzo na kulumila kwa munhu yoyose yosang'hana gehile, kusongela kwa Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi . <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Mbali Mulungu koweng'ha kutogoligwa na kuhongezigwa na utindiwala waja wosang'hana ganogile, kusongela kwa Wayahudi na waja hawali Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Manake Mulungu hamlamula munhu yoyose kwa kumuonela.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Wanhu wose haweli Wayahudi wosang'hana malozo bila kuimanya ndagizi ya Mulungu yamwing'ile Musa wobanangigwa hata kama hawaimanyile ndagizi iyo. Nawaja Wayahudi wosang'hana malozo kuno woimanya ndagizi ya Mulungu yamwing'ile Musa wokwiza kulamuligwa na ndagizi izo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kwavija waja wotogoligwa na Mulungu sio waja woihulika tu ndagizi, ila waja woitegeleza na kusang'hana viilonda ndagizi wao wonda watogoligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Kamavija wanhu waja haweli Wayahudi walibule ndagizi, mbali kwakulongozigwa na nhonga zao wosang'hana kama viilonda ndagizi iyo kuno, baho yolagusa kua wosang'hana gaja galondeka na ndagizi, hata kama hawaimanya ndagizi. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Viwotenda wolagusa kua wowinza viilonda ndagizi. Nhonga zao zolagusa ivija mbuli iyo, kwavija nhonga zao mala zimwenga zolagusa kua wobena ndagizi, na mala zimwenga zolagusa kua woiwinza ndagizi. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Baho, kuilinga na Usenga uno Unogile uniwaligulila, ivo vonda iwe zua da kulamula Mulungu vonda yalamule mbuli za chifiso cha wanhu kubitila Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi na ndagizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Nagweye vilihi? Gweye mwenyego koikema Muyahudi, koitumanila ndagizi na koigodela kua gweye kwa munhu wa Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />kogamanya goyolonda Mulungu na kodaha kusagula dija dilondeka kwavija kofundigwa na ndagizi, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />gweye koiona kua chilongozi wa vipofu na bung'hulo kwa waja weli mdiziza, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />koiona kua mfundaji wa wabozi na mfundaji wa waja hawamanyile ukweli wa Mulungu. Kunao ubala wenele wa ilimu na kweli, kwavija kuna ndagizi yokwing'ha kumanya nzewele na ubala. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Baho, gweye kowafunda wamwenga, habali huifunda gweye mwenyego? Kowaligulila wamwenga sekewebe, kumbe na gweye kokwiba. <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Kolonga, “Sekeutende ugoni,” na kuno gweye kotenda ugoni, koihila milungu ya nyang'iti kuno gweye kokwiba mzing'anda za kufugamila milungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Kwa kuigoda ati koimanya ndagizi ya Mulungu, ivo huona kua kwa kutoitegeleza ndagizi komzeleu Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Kamavija Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigalonga, “Wanhu wa isi zimwenga womliga Mulungu kwambuli yenu mweye Wayahudi!” <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kwingizigwa kumbi kumwako konoga ng'hani uhaitegeleza ndagizi ya Musa. Mbali kama huitegeleza ndagizi, baho, ihanogile ng'hani kama uhakalile bila kwingila kumbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Kama munhu wa isi zimwenga hengile kumbi yahaita goya kama ndagizi viilonda, Mulungu komtogola munhu iyo kama kengila kumbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Wanhu wa isi zimwenga waja hawengile kumbi mbali woitegeleza ndagizi, wokulamula gweye Muyahudi huitegeleza ndagizi, kuno kunago Mayandiko ga ndagizi na kwingila kumbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Iyo kulonga, sio chila yaleligwe na Muyahudi kokua Muyahudi wa kweli, ivija munhu hawa Muyahudi wa kweli kwambuli ya kwingila kumbi, <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Myahudi wa kweli ni ija yeli Muyahudi kwa mmoyo, manake ija yengile kumbi mmoyo. Ino ni mbuli ya Muhe, na sio mbuli ya Mayandiko ga ndagizi. Munhu yeli ivo, habokela nhogolwa kulawa kwa wanhu, mbali kulawa kwa Mulungu mwenyego.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ivo, Muyahudi kana choni chibitile wamwenga? Hebu kwingila kumbi kofaya choni? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Enaa, kua Muyahudi kofaya ng'hani. Mosi, Mulungu kaweng'ha Wayahudi usenga wake. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Mbali yokuwaze kama Wayahudi wamwenga hawamtumanila Mulungu? Ivo, kama hachimtumanila Mulungu mbuli iyo yomtenda Mulungu sekeyatumaniligwe? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Habule! Mulungu kogendelela kusang'hana chija chiyalongile mazua gose, hata ihawa chila munhu mvwizi. Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Chila uhalonga mbuli zako ni zakweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">na muulamuzi, gweye kohuma.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Mbali yahawa ubananzi wetu wolagusa kua Mulungu kosang'hana bila kumuonela munhu, cholonga choni? Ivo, cholonga kua hatenda goya yahachilamula? Hano nolonga chiunhu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Haidahika hata chidogo! Kama Mulungu yahawile wa komuonela munhu, yahadaheze kuwalamula wanhu wa isi yose? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Kaidi wanhu wodaha kulonga kua kama uvwizi wangu wotaza wanhu wamwenga waone bila kifiso kua Mulungu wakutumaniligwa, nao wogendelela kumtogola. Ivo habali ching'hali cholamuligwa kua watenda malozo? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Baho iilinga na kulonga, chitende ubananzi ili chipate ganogile! Ivo wamwenga viwachilongile kwa uvwizi kwa kuchilongeleza kua chofunda ivo. Wanhu wolonga ivo, wolamuligwa kuilinga na ubananzi wao.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wose watenda malozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Ivo, chilongeze, ivo, cheye Wayahudi chofaya ng'hani kubita wamwenga? Siivo mbee! Manake nivimanya kulawa mwanduso kua Wayahudi na wanhu wa isi zimwenga wose chigogigwa na malozo. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Habule hata imwe mtenda goya,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />habule hata imwe yeli na nzewele, hebu habule yolonda kummanya Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Wose wamleka Mulungu wose wabananga, habule yosang'hana gayalonda Mulungu, habule hata imwe.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Mbuli zao zihile ziwalonga ni kama chinusi chilawa mdipanga hadigubikigwe, milimi yao imema uvwizi, mmilomo yao molawa ulonzi uli na sumu ng'hali kama ya nyoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Milomo yao imema mbuli za nyinukila na mbuli zilumiza wamwenga.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Magulu gao gokimbilila kuita kukoma wanhu,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />hohose hawagenda wogala ubananzi na kuwadununza wanhu.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Hawamanya kukala kwa utindiwala na wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Hawalonda mbe kumtegeleza Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Chivimanya kua ndagizi yowemila waja walongozigwa na ndagizi iyo, kaidi hawadaha kuigombela kwa mbuli yoyose, na isi zose zokwiza kulamuligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Manake habule munhu yoyose yonda yatogoligwe na Mulungu kwa kugoga ndagizi, kwavija sang'hano ya ndagizi nikumlagusila munhu tu kua kana malozo.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatogola wanhu kwa vija viwamtumanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Mbali sambi Mulungu kalagusa nzila ya wanhu kudaha kua watogoligwa nayo, bila kutumanila ndagizi. Hata ndagizi za Musa na Mayandiko ga walagusi wa Mulungu golonga bila kifiso mbuli iyo. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Mulungu kowatogola wanhu kua watenda goya kwa nzila ya kumtogola Yesu Kilisito, Mulungu kowatenda ivo kwa waja wose womtogola, kabule kumuonela munhu yoyose. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Wanhu wose wagiza kutegelezigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Mulungu kachitendela vinogile ng'hani kubita vija vichilondeke kupata, kwa nzila ya Yesu Kilisito kachikombola na kuchisegezela malozo getu. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Mulungu kamlava Yesu ili kwa damu yake yawe nzila ya kuwasegezela wanhu malozo gao kwa kutogola kwao. Katenda ivo ili yadahe kulagusa kua iyo kosang'hana vija viilondeka. Baho umwaka Mulungu kakala yofunya moyo bila kugesa malozo ga wanhu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Katenda ivo ili yatende vija viilondeka kwa chipindi chino kwa kuwapetela wanhu wose womtogola Yesu wawe watogoligwa nayo.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ivo, chodaha kuigodela choni? Ivo, kwambuli ya kuigoga ndagizi? Habule! Mbali kwavija chotogola. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Kwavija Mulungu komtogola munhu kua mtenda goya kwa kumtumanila Yesu, sio kwa kuitegeleza ndagizi viilonda. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Hebu vilihi, Mulungu ni Mulungu wa Wayahudi waiyeka, hebu ivija wa wanhu wa isi zimwenga? Enaa, wa wanhu wa isi zimwenga ivija. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Mulungu imwe, nayo kowatogola Wayahudi kua watenda goya kwa kumtumanila Yesu na wanhu wa isi zimwenga ivija kwa kutogola kwao. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ivo, chihatumila kutogola chohindula ndagizi? Hambe, chihawinza nzila ya kutogola chosang'hana vija viilonda ndagizi.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ivo chilonge choni kwambuli ya Ibulahimu tata yetu? Ivo kadahaze kuimanya mbuli ino ya kutogoligwa na Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Kama Ibulahimu kakala yatendigwe mtenda goya kwa usang'hanaji wake mkulu, ivo, kanacho chinhu cha kuigodela kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Manake Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga, “Ibulahimu kamtogola Mulungu, nayo Mulungu kamtogola kua mtendagoya.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Msang'hanaji kolihigwa chitumetume, na chitumetume chake sio nhunza ila chiyalondeka kulihigwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Mbali munhu ija hatumanila sang'hano zake mwenyego, mbali komtogola Mulungu ija yowalekesela malozo waja wabananzi, baho, Mulungu koigesa nhogola ya munhu iyo, na kumtogola kua mtendagoya. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Nayo Daudi kalonga mbuli iija kwambuli ya ganogile ga Mulungu ga munhu ija Mulungu yomtogola kua mtendagoya bila kugesa sang'hano zake.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Wamweda waja walekeseligwe malozo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">waja malozo gao gafutigwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Kana deng'o kulu munhu ija Mndewa kogasemwa malozo gake.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Ivo ndeng'helo ino yailongile Daudi ni kwa waja wengile kumbi waiyeka, hebu na waja hawengile kumbi? Kwavija chimala kulonga, “Ibulahimu katogola, nayo Mulungu kamtogola kua munhu mtendagoya.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ivo, Ibulahimu katogoligwa na Mulungu yang'hali kwingila kumbi, hebu viyengile kumbi? Katogoligwa yang'hali kwingila kumbi na sio viyengile kumbi. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ibulahimu kengila kumbi hamwande, na kwingila kumbi kumwake kukala na chilaguso chigangamize kua Mulungu kamtogola kua munhu mtenda goya kwambuli ya kutogola kwake kuyakalile nayo kabula hanakwingila kumbi. Kwaivo, Ibulahimu kawa tata wa waja wose hata kwa waja hawengile kumbi, mbali wamtogola Mulungu, watogoligwa kua watenda goya. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ibulahimu ivija ni tata wa waja wengile kumbi, mbali sio kwavija wengila kumbi, ila kwavija wowinza nzila iija ya kutogola ya tata yetu Ibulahimu iyawinzile yang'hali hanakwingila kumbi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laliko da Mulungu dobokeligwa kwa kutogola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Mulungu kamlalika Ibulahimu na ulelo wake kua isi yose ihawile yao. Lagano ijo haditendile kwavija Ibulahimu kaigoga ndagizi, mbali kwavija kamtogola Mulungu, katogoligwa kua mtenda goya. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Manake kama waja weng'higwe gago gayalalike Mulungu ni waja waitegeleze ndagizi waiyeka, baho, kutogola kwabule mana yoyose, na lagano da Mulungu si chinhu. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Mulungu kogwa ludoko wanhu kama hawategeleza ndagizi yake, mbali kama habule ndagizi, habule malozo ga kuleka kuitegeleza ndagizi.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Baho, laliko dino dotumanila kutogola, na ivo laliko dolawila kwa unovu wa Mulungu, ivija ni ukweli uiyeka kua laliko ijo kwambuli ya wose. Sio kwa waja weng'higwe ndagizi waiyeka, mbali na kwa waja womtogola Mulungu kama viyatendile Ibulahimu. Iyo ni tata yetu cheye chose. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe, “Nikwika uwe tata wa wanhu wa isi zose.” Ibulahimu keng'higwa laliko ijo kulawa kwa Mulungu nayo kamtogola Mulungu ija yoweng'ha ugima waja wafile, na ija yolonga vinhu havikalile baho vilawile. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibulahimu katogola na kutumanila Mulungu, hata kama ikala vidala kutumanila, mbali kagendelela kutogola, ivo kawa tata wa wanhu wengi kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,“Ulelo wako womema kama nhondo! <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ibulahimu kakala mvele behi na milao mia moja, mbali kutogola kwake hakuhunguke hata kama kavimanya lukuli lwake lukala kama munhu yafile, ivija mwehe wake, Sala, kakala mgumba. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ibulahimu kagendelela kutogola dija laliko da Mulungu, kakala na ludabwa kwa kutogola kwake, kamfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Kavimanya kua Mulungu kodaha kumwing'ha gaja gose gayamlalike. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Iyomana Mulungu kamtogola kua mtenda goya. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Viilongigwa, “Mulungu kamtogola Ibulahimu,” hailongigwa kwambuli Ibulahimu yaiyeka, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ila mbuli ino yetu cheye ivija waja chimtogola Mulungu yamzilibule Yesu, Mndewa wetu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Mulungu kamlava Yesu ili yakomigwe kwambuli ya malozo getu, kaidi kamzilibula ili chitogoligwe na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa na ubwiga na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Baho, kwavija chitogoligwa na Mulungu kwanzila ya kutogola, ivo china utindiwala nayo Mulungu kwanzila ya Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa kubitila kutogola Yesu, Mulungu kaching'ha ganogile gake. Mbaka sambi chogendelela kukala muunovu uo. Baho chodeng'helela ng'hani kwavija chotumanila kwingila muukulu wa Mulungu! <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Enaa, si gago tu mbali chodeng'helela ivija mmadununzo kuno chivimanya kua madununzo gogala kufunyamoyo, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />nako kufunyamoyo kogala kugangamala, nao kugangamala kogala tamanilo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Najo tamanilo hadichitenda chihombe, manake Mulungu kamala kuching'ha wende wake umemile mmoyo kwanzila ya Muhe wa Mulungu yaching'ile.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Vichikalile chabule wakuchitaza kuchilohola, Kilisito, saa viivikile, kadanganika kwambuli yetu cheye chili na ubananzi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Havidahika munhu kudanganika kwambuli ya munhu mtendagoya, mbali yodahika munhu kudanganika kwambuli ya munhu mnovu. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Mbali Mulungu kachilagusila kua kana wende na cheye, haja vichikalile ching'hali na malozo, Kilisito kadanganika kwambuli yetu. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Sambi chitogoligwa na Mulungu kwa damu ya Kilisito, ukweli uiyeka kua kochilohola muuludoko lwa Mulungu! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Manake vichikalile ching'hali wahasanyi wa Mulungu, Mulungu kachilumba nayo kwa ifa ya Mwanage. Kwavija sambi chilumbigwa nayo, nikweli kua chokwiza kuloholigwa kwa ugima wa Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Sio gago tu, mbali chodeng'helela ivija na Mulungu kwanzila ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ija yachilumbile na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kwanzila ya munhu imwe malozo gengila mziisi zose, nayo igala ifa. Ivo ifa yenela kwa wanhu wose, kwamana wose watenda malozo. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ndagizi ikala ing'hali kuvika, malozo gakala gavika mziisi, mbali malozo hagakumbukigwa kama habule ndagizi. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Mbali kulawa kwa Adamu mbaka chipindi cha Musa, ifa iwavikila hata waja hawasang'hane malozo kama gaja ga Adamu, ga kuleka kumtegeleza Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu kakala chilaguso cha ija yokwiza.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Mbali malozo ga Adamu hagadaha kuilinga na unovu wa Mulungu. Manake, hata kama malozo ga munhu imwe gagala ifa ya wanhu wose, mbali kwa wende wa munhu imwe, iyo Yesu Kilisito, Mulumgu kawongezela wose unovu wake na gweko jake. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Hana tafauti ya gweko da Mulungu na malozo ga munhu ija imwe. Manake viyalozile munhu imwe, Mulungu kalava ulamuzi, mbali viwalozile wanhu wengi, Mulungu kaweng'ha gweko jake kwa kuwalekesela malozo gao. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kweli malozo ga munhu imwe, ifa isonga kwenela na wanhu wasonga kudanganika kwambuli ya munhu iyo imwe, mbali niukweli uiyeka kua chiyatendile ija munhu imwe, yani Yesu Kilisito, chinoga ng'hani. Wose wobokela unovu wa Mulungu na gweko ijo da kutendigwa kuwabule malozo, wokwimila hamwe muugima kwanzila ya ija imwe, manake Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ivo, kama kuloza kwa munhu imwe kugala ulamuzi kwa wanhu wose, ivija sang'hano ilibule malozo ga munhu imwe yoweng'ha wanhu wose kukala bule malozo na ugima. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kuleka kutegeleza kwa munhu imwe wanhu wengi waoneka na malozo, ivija kutegeleza kwa munhu imwe kuwatenda wanhu wengi watogoligwe na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ndagizi ilawila, iswangiza kwongezeka kwa ubananzi, mbali haja malozo vigongezeke, unovu wa Mulungu wongezeka ng'hani. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Kama vija malozo vigali na udahi na kugala ifa kwa wanhu, ivija unovu wa Mulungu vuuli na udahi wa kuwatenda wanhu watogoligwe na Mulungu na kugala ugima ulibule uhelelo kwa nzila ya Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kudanganika mmalozo na kukala muugima na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ivo chilonge choni? Ivo chigendelele kutenda malozo ili unovu wa Mulungu wongezeke? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Habule! Kuja kulonda kutenda malozo mmwetu kudanganika, chodahaze kugendelela kukala mmalozo? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Manake, kubitila kubatizigwa chiilumba nayo muuifa yake mvimanya kua cheye chibatizigwe chiilumba na Kilisito Yesu. Kwanzila ya kubatizigwa chiilumba nayo muiifa yake. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Vichibatizigwe chiilumba nayo na chiwandigwa hamwe nayo muiifa yake, ili kama vija Kilisito viyazilibuligwe kwanzila ya ukulu wa Tata, cheye ivija chidahe kukala muugima wa sambi.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Manake kama cheye chiilumba nayo muiifa yake, ivija chokwiza kuilumba nayo kwa kuzilibuligwa kama iyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Chivimanya kua unhu wetu wa mwaka ufa na uwambigwa muumsalaba hamwe na Kilisito, ili uja unhu wa malozo ubanangike, sekechiwe watumwa wa malozo kaidi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Manake, munhu yadanganike kama ivo, kakonzoligwa kulawa mmalozo. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ivo, ihawa chidanganika hamwe na Kilisito, chotogola kua ivija chokwiza kukala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Manake chivimanya kua Kilisito kamala kuzilibuka na hafa kaidi, ifa haimdaha kaidi. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ivo, Kilisito viyadanganike, kadanganika mala lumwe tu, malozo gabule ludabwa kaidi kwambuli yake na sambi kokala kwambuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Namweye ivija molondeka muione kua mufa kwa mbuli ya malozo, mbali muione wanhu mokala kwa kuilumba hamwe na Mulungu kwa kumtogola Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Kwaivo malozo sekegawagaze kaidi mzing'huli zenu izo zidanganika, naivo sekeziwatende kuzitegeleza maya zake. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Hebu sekemlave hata hanhu hamwe mzing'huli zenu chiwe chilungo cha kusang'hana ubananzi na malozo. Badili yake, muilavile mweye wenyego kwa Mulungu kama wanhu wazilibuligwe, ilaveni wenyego kwa Mulungu kwambuli ya kutogoligwa nayo. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Baho malozo hagawagazeni kaidi, manake hamlongozigwa na ndagizi, mbali kwa unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumwa wa kusang'hana galondeka na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Baho, chilonge choni? Ivo, chisang'hane malozo kwavija hachilongozigwa na ndagizi ila kwa kulongozigwa na unovu wa Mulungu? Hambee! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Mvimanya kua mhailava wenyego kama watumwa na kumtegeleza munhu, mokua watumwa wake kweli munhu iyo, hebu mwahailava wenyego kua watumwa wa malozo gaja hachikomelezo chenu ni ifa, hebu kwa kutegeleza Mulungu haichikomelezo motogoligwa nayo. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Baho mwaka mkala watumwa wa malozo, mbali sambi nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kwavija mtogola mmoyo kutegeleza mahala gamwing'higwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Mkomboligwa kulawa muutumwa wa Malozo, muwa watumwa wa gatogoligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Nilonga na mweye kwa ulonzi kwa kutumila mfano uo wa mtumwa ili mmanye chinilonga. Umwaka mkala watumwa wa malozo kwa kuilava wenyego kua via va kusang'hana gehile, na malozo genu gongezeka ng'hani. Kwaivo sambi molondeka muilave kwa Mulungu muugima wenu wose, mkale watumwa kwa mbuli zomtogola Mulungu zija zolagusa kua mweye ni wanhu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Vumkalile watumwa wa malozo mkala muinega kutali na goyotogoligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Mbali vumkalile watumwa wa malozo, mkala kutali na Mulungu hamgesile kusang'hana gaja goyolonda Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Mbali sambi mkomboligwa kulawa utumwa wa malozo na muwa watumigwa wa Mulungu, sambi mweye mmweda kua wanhu wa Mulungu, na malawilo gake ni ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Manake uhagasang'hanila malozo malawilo gake ni ifa, mbali gweko diyalava Mulungu ni ugima ulibule uhelelo kwa kuilumba na Kilisito Yesu, Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa zengele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Walukolo wangu, sambi nolonga na mweye, wanhu waja mzimanyile goya ndagizi za Musa. Mvimanya kua ndagizi yomlongoza munhu yang'hali mgima. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kwa mfano, mwehe yasoligwe kolongozigwa na ndagizi saa zose mulume wake yeli mgima, mbali mulume wake yahafa, ndagizi iyo haimlongoza kaidi iyo mwanachike. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ivo mwanachike iyo yahasoligwa na mulume imwenga kuno mulume wake yang'hali mgima, kokemigwa mgoni. Baho mulume wake yahafa, mwanachike iyo halongozigwa na ndagizi, na yahasoligwa na mulume imwenga, hakemigwa mgoni. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ivija na mweye walukolo wangu, mweye hamlongozigwa kaidi na ndagizi ya Musa kwavija unhu wenu wa umwaka ufa hamwe na Kilisito, sambi mweye mwa wanhu wake iyo yazilibuligwe ili mdahe kusang'hana goya muisang'hano ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Vichikalile chowinza lukuli vilulonda, ndagizi iswangizigwa maya zetu zipate ludabwa ng'hani, chikala cholonda kutenda malozo ng'hani, kwambuli iyo ifa ilawila. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Baho umwaka chikala chifungigwe na ndagizi, mbali sambi chilekesigwa kulawa mzindagizi. Sambi chomsang'hanila Mulungu kuilinga na ugima wa sambi ulongozigwa na Muhe wake.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagizi na Malozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Ivo, chilonge choni, chilonge kua ndagizi iyo ni malozo? Hambee! Mbali ndagizi inhenda nivimanye malozo ni chinhu gani, kama ndagizi ya Musa ihalekile kulonga, “Seke uwe na maya.” Nihalekile kuvimanya kua na maya na chinhu cha imwenga ni malozo. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Kwa ndagizi iyo, malozo gapata nyafasi ya kwinula maya ihile mmoyo wangu. Manake bila ndagizi malozo ni chinhu chifile. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Baho umwaka ng'hala mgima bila kulongozingwa na ndagizi, mbali viniimanyile ndagizi viilonda malozo genuka, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />nanie gangalila kulamuligwa ifa. Ndagizi iyo ikala kwambuli ya kugala ugima, kumwangu igala ifa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Kwaivo, malozo gapata nyafasi ya kunivwizila kubitila ndagizi iyo, na kungalila kulamuligwa ifa.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Baho, ndagizi yenyego ilawa kwa Mulungu na lagizo denyego dilawa kwa Mulungu, na zosang'hana galondigwa na Mulungu na zinoga. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ivo, iyo mana kua chija chinogile chinigalila kulamuligwa ifa yangu? Hambee! Viili ni kua malozo ili gaoneke hazelu kua malozo, itumila ija ndagizi inogile na kunigalila kulamuligwa ifa yangu. Ivo, kwanzila ya ija ndagizi, malozo gailagusa chinaganaga vija vigali gehile ng'hani.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ondo ilimgati mwa munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Chivimanya kua ndagizi zolawa kwa Muhe wa Mulungu, mbali nie ni munhu nili na malozo, nie ni mtumwa wa malozo. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Kwavija sitambula chinisang'hana, manake chija chinilonda sichisang'hana, mbali chija chinilema icho nochisang'hana. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ivo ihawa, nosang'hana chimbidu cha chija chinilonda, ino maanake kua notogola kua ija ndagizi inoga. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ivo, sinie iyo nisang'hana chinhu chihile, mbali gaja malozo gokala mgati yangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Nivimanya kua habule dinogile mgati yangu, kuilinga na uzidilwa wangu wa malozo. Kwavija, hata kama nolonda kusang'hana mbuli inogile, sidaha kuisang'hana. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Manake badili ya kusang'hana mbuli ija inogile inilonda, nie nosang'hana dija dihile dinilema kudisang'hana. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ivo, kama nosang'hana chimbidu na dija dinilonda nie, ino ina mana kua si nie nisang'hane gago, mbali ni gaja malozo gokala mgati yangu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Baho, niimanya mbuli ino, nihalonda kusang'hana mbuli inogile, mbuli ihile yolawila bahaja. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Mmoyo wangu noideng'helela ndagizi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Mbali noona kua hana ndagizi imwenga isang'hana sang'hano mulukuli lwangu, ndagizi ija haiilumba na nzewele yangu. Ndagizi iyo yonhenda niwe mtumwa wa malozo ija ili mgati yangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nhendeze wayangu! Yelihi yodaha kunilohola kulawa mulukuli luno lunigala muiifa? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Nomwing'ha hewela kwa Mulungu yonilohola kubitila ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kwaivo, nie mwenyego kwa nzewele zangu, noisang'hanila ndagizi ya Mulungu, mbali kwa lukuli lwangu nosang'hana malozo.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Ugima muu Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Kwaivo sambi Mulungu hawenukila waja wailumbile na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwavija ndagizi ya Muhe wa Mulungu igala ugima kwa kuilumba na Kilisito Yesu ining'ha kuilegeha kulawa muindagizi ya malozo na ifa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Mulungu kasang'hana mbuli ija ndagizi ipotigwa kusang'hana kwambuli ya uzidilwa wa chiunhu. Mulungu kamtuma Mwanage yeli na lukuli uilingile na ng'huli zetu cheye chili na malozo, ili yagahume malozo, na kwalukuli lulo kagamala malozo. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Mulungu kasang'hana ivo ili viilonda ndagizi isang'hanike goya kumwetu cheye chili na ugima, sio kwa ludabwa lwa lukuli, mbali kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulugu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Manake waja wokala kwa kuwinza lukuli vuulonda, wolongozigwa na vuutonga lukuli. Mbali waja wokala kwakuwinza Muhe wa Mulungu viyalonda, wotonga vija Muhe wa Mulungu viyolonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Wanhu wolongozigwa na vuugesa lukuli wogala ifa, mbali viyagesa Muhe wa Mulungu ni kugala ugima na utindiwala. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Kwavija vuugesa lukuli ni uhasanyi kwa Mulungu, manake haitegeleza ndagizi ya Mulungu, hebu haidaha kuitegeleza. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Wanhu wogesa vuulonda lukuli hawadaha kumnogeza Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Mbali mweye hamkala kuuwinza vuulonda lukuli, mbali yahawa Muhe wa Mulungu kokala mgati yenu, baho mweye hamkala kama vuulonda lukuli ila mokala kama viyalonda Muhe wa Mulungu. Yoyose yalibule Muhe wa Kilisito, iyo sio wake Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Mbali yahawa Kilisito kamgati yenu, hata yahawa ng'huli zenu zonda kudanganika kwambuli ya malozo, kumwenu muhe una ugima kwavija mtogoligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ihawa Muhe wa Mulungu yamzilibule Yesu kokala mgati yenu, baho iyo yamzilibule Kilisito kozing'ha ugima ng'huli zenu zija zifa, kosang'hana ivo kwanzila ya Muhe wake yokala mgati yenu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kwaivo walukolo wangu, chinayo sang'hano, mbali sio yakukala kwa kuwinza ng'huli zetu vizilonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Baho mhakala kuwinza vizilonda ng'huli zenu, kweli mofa. Mbali muhakala kwa kulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu mhalema kusang'hana sang'hano za ubananzi, baho mokala na ugima. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Wose wolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu wao iyo wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Kwavija, hambokele Muhe wa utumwa ugala woga, mbali mumbokela Muhe ija yomtendani mweye kua wana wa Mulungu, na kwa Muhe iyo, cheye chomkema Mulungu,“Aba,” iyo kulonga “Tata!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Nayo Muhe mwenyego kochilongela mmuhe mmwetu kua kweli cheye cha wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ivo, kwavija cheye cha wana wa Mulungu, baho chobokela ganogile gose golawa kwa Mulungu gaja gayawekile wanhu wake, na chobokela gago hamwe na Kilisito, enaa, chihadununzigwa hamwe na Kilisito, chokwinuligwa hamwe nayo.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu ukwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Noona kua madununzo gano ga sambi si chinhu mbee, kama nihagalinga na ukulu uja Mulungu yokwiza kuching'ha baho kumwande. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Kwavija vilumbe vose vokalizila ng'hani Mulungu yawalagusile wana wake. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Kwavija vilumbe vikigwa bila ludabwa, sio kama viwalonda, mbali watendigwa ivo kwa vija viyalonda Mulungu. Hataivo dabaho tamanilo, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Vilumbe ivo navo voloholigwa kulawa muutumwa wa unanzi, vize viilegehe muukulu wa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Kwavija chivimanya kua mbaka vino sambi, vilumbe vose volila kwa usungu kama uja wa mwanachike kuibasula mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Hebu sio vilumbe ivo viiyeka, mbali hata cheye chili na iyo Muhe, iyo yeli wa mosi wa gweko da Mulungu, ivija choiyalala mgati yetu, kuno chobeta kutendigwa wana wa Mulungu, na cheye chikomboligwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwavija tamanilo ijo cheye chiloholigwa. Mbali tamanilo hadifaya kama chokiona icho ichitumanila. Manake yelihi yotamanila chija kamala kuchiona? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Kama chihachitumanila chija ching'hali hachinakiona, baho, chokibeta kwa kufunya moyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Cheye chili na uzidilwa mbali Muhe wa Mulumgu kochitaza kwakukosa ludabwa kumwetu, manake hachidaha vichilondeka kupula, mbali Muhe mwenyego kochipulila kwa Mulungu kwa giogio vija haidahika kuilonga. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Nayo Mulungu yolola mbaka mgati ya miyoyo ya wanhu, kovimanya viyatonga iyo Muhe, manake iyo Muhe kowapulila wanhu wa Mulungu kuwinza vija Mulungu viyalonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Chivimanya kua, mzimbuli zose, Mulungu kosang'hana sang'hano na kutenda goya hamwe na waja wose weli na wende na Mulungu, manake ni waja yawakemile kwambuli zake. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Wanhu waja kawasagula kulawa haumwanduso, iyo yawabagule weze wailinge na Mwanage, ili Mwana wake yawe wa mosi hagati mwa walukolo wengi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ivo, waja Mulungu yawabagule iyo yawakemile, na wao yawakemile iyo yawatendile kua wakutogoligwa nayo na wao yawatogole iyo yaweng'ile ukulu wake.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wende wa Mulungu kubitila Kilisito Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Kwaivo, chilonge choni mzimbuli zino? Ihawa Mulungu kaubanzi wetu, yelihi kodaha kua chimbidu na cheye? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Mulungu hamkimile Mwanage yaiyeka, mbali kamlava kwambuli yetu cheye wose. Ihawa katenda ivo, ivo, haching'ha ivija ganogile gose? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Yelihi yonda yawalongeleze wasaguligwe na Mulungu? Mulungu mwenyego iyo yawatogole kua wanhu wake! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Yelihi yonda yawalamule? Habule! Kwavija Kilisito Yesu iyo yadanganike, kaidi kazilibuka na kakala ubanzi wa kutogoligwa kwa Mulungu. Iyo kochipulila! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Yelihi kodaha kuchibagula na wende wa Kilisito? Ivo, kugaya hebu udala hebu madununzo hebu nzala ng'hulu hebu chikumbi muyega, hebu bung'hukila hebu kuitoa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kwambuli yako, chozambwigwa na ifa misi na chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">chotendigwa kama bung'hukilalo wa kuchinjigwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Mbali mzimbuli zino zose, chihuma uhumi mkulu kwautazi wake Kilisito yaching'ile wende. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Baho, nivimanya kua habule chinhu chochose chidaha kuchigola na wende wake, si ifa hebu ugima, hata watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu hebu weli na udaho, hata golawila sambi hebu gonda kulawila hamwande, hebu weli na udaho, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />hebu isi ya uchanha, hebu wa hasi. Habule chilumbe chochose chidaha kuchigola na wende wa Mulungu uli na Kilisito Yesu Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu na wanhu wake Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Kilisito kovimanya kua chino chinilonga ni ukweli uiyeka. Hata mmoyo wangu ulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu nao wolagusa kua silonga uvwizi. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Nonda kulonga vino, nina giogio kulu na usungu uja haumala mmoyo wangu, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />kwambuli ya walukolo wangu waja wamuiisi yangu! Kama ihawile yowataza wao, nihatogole kwinukiligwa na kubaguligwa na Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Wao iyo wanhu wa isi ya Izilaeli waja Mulungu yawabagule wawe wanage, kawalongela ukulu wake, waitogolela kuikila malagano kaweng'ha ndagizi zake, vija viilondeka kumfugamila na ndagizi zake. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Hao Waizilaeli ni wazukulu wa wasaho, nayo Kilisito, kwa uja unhu wake, kalawa mulukolo lwao. Mulungu yolongoza vinhu vose, na yatogoligwe mazua gose bila uhelelo! Pepaa.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Silonga kua laliko da Mulungu dipotigwa, kwavija sio wanhu wose wa Izilaeli wanhu wa kweli wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Hebu sio ulelo wose wa Ibulahimu ni wanage wa kweli. Ila kama vigandikigwe Mayandiko ga Mulungu, “Waleligwa wake wolawa kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Iyo kulonga, sio wana wose wa Ibulahimu waleligwe kama wanhu wamwenga viwaleligwe iyo wana wa Mulungu, mbali waja waleligwe kulawa mdilagano da Mulungu iyo wonda wakemigwe wanage Ibulahimu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Mbali lagano denyego iyo dino, “Mumsimo kama uno nobwela, nayo Sala kokua kaibasula mwana wa chilume.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Sio gago tu, ila nayo Lebeka kalela mapacha kwa tata imwe, iyo Isaka, msao yetu. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Mbali ili Mulungu yaoneke kua kana hiyali ya kusagula, hata ing'hali wana waja wa tata imwe hawanaleligwa na kudaha kufambula dihile na dinogile. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Lebeka kalongeligwa kua, “Mwana mkulu komsamsang'hanila magati.” Ivo usaguzi wa Mulungu wogesa vija viyamkema munhu mwenyego, na sio kwa sang'hano ya chiunhu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe, “Yakobo ninawende nayo mbali Esau nimlema.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Chilonge choni baho? Mulungu hadaha kutenda viilondeka? Hambee! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Mulungu kamlongela Musa, “Nokwiza kumonela bazi munhu yoyose inilonda kumonela bazi, nokwiza kumonela bazi munhu yoyose inimulonda.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kwaivo, gose gotumanila bazi da Mulungu, sio kwa kuiyoha hebu viyalonda munhu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga vino kwambuli ya Falao, “Nikutenda mfaume ili nilaguse wanhu udaho wangu kubitila gweye, na zina jangu wadilongelele mziisi zose.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Imanyike hazelu, kua Mulungu komuonela bazi munhu yoyose yomlonda kumuonela bazi, na yahalonda kumtenda munhu yawe mdulu, kotenda ivo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludoko lwa Mulungu na bazi da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Hebu kodaha kuniuza, “Kama mbuli zihawa ivo, munhu kodahaze kulaumigwa na Mulungu? Yelihi yodaha kugalema goyolonda Mulungu?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Mbali gweye munhu kwa nani mbaka udahe kuihuma na Mulungu? Ivo, chinongo chodaha kumuuza ija yachilumbile, “Habali kunilumba kama vino?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mvunyanga ulongo kodaha kutumila ulongo uuja kuvunyanga na kulumba vinongo vidi, chinongo chimwe chakutumila wandewa, na chimwenga cha kutumila munhu yoyose.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ivoili kwa Mulungu. Kalonda kulagusa ludoko lwake na kulagusa udaho wake, mbali kakala yowabeta na kawafunyila moyo ng'hani, kwa waja wakalile walondeke kubanangigwa na ludoko lwake. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ili kulagusa wingi wa ukulu wake kwa mbuli ya wanhu waja yawatandile kubokela bazi jake, Mulungu katanda kulawa umwaka kuweng'ha ukulu wake. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Kwavija cheye iyo waja yawakemile, sio kulawa mwa Wayahudi tu mbali kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga ivija. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Vino ivo viyalongile mchitabu cha Hosea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Wanhu waja hawawile wangu nowakema, ‘Wanhu wangu.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Isi ija sikalile na wende nayo noikema, ‘Isi nili na wende nayo.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Haja hawalongeligwe, ‘Mweye si wanhu wangu,’ baho wokemigwa, ‘Wana wa Mulungu yeli na ugima.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Nayo Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu, kalonga kwambuli ya Waizilaeli, “Hata kama ulelo wa Waizilaeli wengi kama msanga wa mhwani, ni wadodo waiyeka wonda waloholigwe, <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />kwavija Mndewa kowenukila wamhu wa isi zose kwa kulopola kama viyalongile.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kama vija Isaya viyalongile baho umwaka, “Mndewa yeli na udaho wose sekeyachilekele wana wamwenga wa Izilaeli, chihamalile kama Sodoma, chihabanangigwe kama Gomola,”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli na Usenga Unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ivo chilonge choni baho? Wanhu waja haweli Waizilaeli hawatendile gatogoligwa na Mulungu, kadaha kutogoligwa na Mulungu kubitila kutogola kwao, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />mbali Waizilaeli waja walondile kutogoligwa na Mulungu kwa kuwinza ndagizi, hawatogoligwe. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Habali? Kwavija watumanila sang'hano zao badili ya kumtogola Mulungu. Waikwala “Mdibwe kulu da kuikwangwala.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />kama vigandikigwe Mmayandiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Loleni nodika dibwe da kuikwala uko Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">ditenda wanhu kuikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">dibwe dija diwatenda wanhu wagwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Mbali waja womtogola iyo hopata chinyala mbee.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Mbwiga zangu, chinilonda ng'hani mmoyo na chiniwapulila ng'hani kwa Mulungu ni kua Waizilaeli wayangu waloholigwe! <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Nodaha kulonga kweli kwambuli yao kua wanhu wano wotenda kila viidahika kumzambwila Mulungu, mbali sio muumanyi wa kweli. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Iyo kulonga hawamanyile vija Mulungu viyowatenda wanhu watogoligwe nayo, na wageza kusonga nzila yao wenyego naivo wailema nzila iyo ya Mulungu ya kuwatenda wanhu watogoligwe nayo. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Kwakwiza Yesu Kilisito, kazitenda ndagizi zioneke sio chinhu cha kutumanila ng'hani kwa waja watogoligwe na Mulungu, ila wanhu wotogoligwa na Mulungu kwa nzila ya kumtogola Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulohozi ni kwambuli ya wanhu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Kwambuli ya kutogoligwa na Mulungu kwa kuitegeleza ndagizi, Musa kandika vino, “Munhu yoyose yosang'hana viilonda ndagizi kokala kwa kuwinza ndagizi iyo.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Mbali kwakua wakutogoligwa na Mulungu kwanzila ya kutogola, yandikigwa vino, “Sekeulonge mmoyo wako, ‘Yelihi yokwela mbaka kuulanga kwa Mulungu?’ Iyo kulonga kumgala Kilisito hasi. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Hebu sekeulonge, ‘Yelihi yohulumuka mbaka isi ya wanhu wafile?’ Iyo kulonga kumzilibula Kilisito,” <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga vino,“Usenga uo wa Mulungu wahabehi nagweye, wammulomo wako na mmoyo wako“ nayo iyo mbuli ichiligula kwambuli ya kumtogola Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Kama uhalonga kwamlomo wako kua Yesu ni Mndewa na kotogola mmoyo wako kua Mulungu kamzilibula, koloholigwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kwavija munhu kodaha kutogoligwa na Mulungu kwakutogola muumoyo wake, na kwakulonga kwa mulomo wake kuloholigwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga, “Chila yomtogola hageligwa chinyala.”<verse eid="ROM 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Mbuli ino ni ya wose, kwani habule tafauti kati ya Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi, Mndewa wa wose ni imwe, nayo ni munhu wa nying'ha ng'hani kwao wose wompula. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigalonga, “Chila munhu yopula kwa zina da Mndewa, koloholigwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Baho, wompulaze iyo hawamtogole? Kaidi womtogolaze kama hawanapata kuhulika mbuli zake? Nao wohulikaze mbuli zake kama habule munhu wa kuligula? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Nao wanhu woligulaze kama hawatumigwe? Kama vigalonga Mayandiko ga Mulungu, “Ni mbuli inogile ng'hani kumuona munhu yoligula Usenga Unogile!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Mbali wose hawaibokele iyo mbuli inogile. Hata Isaya viyalongile, “Mndewa, yelihi yautogole usenga wetu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Uko kutogola kolawila kwa kuhulika mbuli, na mbuli iyo yolawa kwa Usenga wa Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Mbali nouza, ivo, hawauhulike usenga uo? Enaa, wauhulika, kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Wanhu wahulika usenga wao chila hanhu mziisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">Mbuli zao zenela mbaka muuhelelo mwa isi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Kaidi nouza, ivo, wanhu wa Izilaeli hawamanyile? Musa mwenyego iyo munhu wa mosi kuidika mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Nomkemeni mweye wanhu wa isi yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">muwaonele maya wanhu wa isi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">nomtendani muwe na ludoko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">kwa wanhu wa isi ya wabozi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Amala Isaya kalonga kwa ugalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Wanhu waja hawanilondile wamhata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">niilagusa kumwao waja hawauza mbuli zangu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Mbali kwambuli ya Izilaeli kolonga, “Mazua gose nilonda kuilumba na wanhu wangu mbali wao walema kunitegeleza na wanileka.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ubazi wa Mulungu kwa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Baho, nouza, ivo, Mulungu kawalema wanhu wake? Habule! Nie mwenyego ni Muizilaeli, ulelo wa Abulahamu, wa ulonzi wa Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Mulungu hawalemile wanhu wake yawasagule kulawa haumosi. Moisemwa vija vigalonga Mayandiko ga Mulungu kwambuli ya Elia viyailalale kwa Mulungu mbuli ya Waizilaeli ivija womanyika Wayahudi? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Viyalongile, “Mndewa, wakomigwa walagusi wako na kubomola vilemela vako. Nie tu niiyeka nisigale, nao wolonda kung'oma!” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ivo, Mulungu kamwidika choni? Kamlongela, “Niikila wanhu elufu saba waja hawamfugamile Baali wamkemile mulungu.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Baho, Mulungu kawasagula wanhu kwambuli ya unovu wake, wabaho wamwenga wasigale waja Mulungu yawabagule kwambuli ya unovu wake. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Kubagula kwake kolawila kwa unovu wake na sio kwambuli ya sangh‘ano zao. Hata kama kubagula kwake kolawa kwa sang'hano za wanhu, uhalekile kua unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ivo, chilonge choni? Chija wanhu wa Izilaeli wakala wochizambwila hawakipatile, mbali waja wasaguligwe wachipata. Wamwenga watendigwa waleke kuumanya usenga, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />kama vigalonga Mayandiko ga Mulungu, “Mulungu kaitenda mioyo yao ileke kuumanya usenga, mbaka vino sambi hawadaha kuona kwa meso gao hebu kuhulika kwa magutwi gao.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Nayo Daudi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Wahawa muindia zao na ziwe nyambo na mtego wakuwenzeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">wagwe na kwinukiligwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Meso gao gageligwe ziza sekegadahe kuona. Migongo yao mazua gose iveduke kwa kugaya kwao!”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Baho nouza, ivo, Wayahudi waikwala mbaka hawainuke kaidi? Habule! Kwambuli ya chiwabanange ulohozi uwezila wanhu wa isi zimwenga, ili Wayahudi wawaonele maya. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ubananzi wa Wayahudi ugala ganogile mengi ga Mulungu kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga, na ihawa malozo ga Wayahudi gagala ganogile mengi ga Mulungu muiisi, na kubananga kwao kugala ganogile mengi kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga, ivo yokuwaze kama Wayahudi wose wahaubokela ulohozi, baho wanhu haweli Wayahudi wobokela ganogile mengi ga Mulungu?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulohozi wa wanhu haweli Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Mbali sambi nowalongeleni mweye wanhu wa isi zimwenga. Kwavija nie iyo Mulungu yanisagule niwe msenga wa wanhu haweli Wayahudi, noigodela sang'hano yangu. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ili mhate kuwatenda Wayahudi wayangu wawaonele maya mweye, naivo mhate kuwalohola wamwenga wao. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kama kulemigwa kwao kugala kuilumba na Mulungu kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga, yokuwaze wahatogoligwa na Mulungu? Yokua kama wafile wozilibuka!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Yahawa chihande cha mosi cha mgate chilavigwa kwa Mulungu, baho mgate wose nao ni wa Mulungu, na kama mizizi ya mbiki ilavigwa kwa Mulungu, baho na makwamvi gose ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Enaa, makwamvi gamwenga ga mbiki wa mzeituni mdikonde gakanhigwa, haja hakanhigwe wabandikiza makwamvi ga mbiki wa mzeituni mbago. Mweye wanhu wa isi zimwenga ni kama makwamvi ga mzeituni mbago, mulumbigwa kua hamwe na makwamvi gasigale ga mzeituni wa mdikonde. Mopata ndia kubitila mizizi ya mzaituni uo, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ivo seke muigodele kwa waja wakanhigwe kama makwamvi! Hata mwahawa na dakuigodela, seke muisemwe kua sio mweye muidahiza mizizi ila mizizi iyo iwadahiza mweye mkale goya.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Mbali kokwiza kulonga, “Makwamvi gakanhigwa ili nie mhate kubandikigwa haja hagalawile.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Enaa! Kakanhigwa kwa kupotigwa kutogola, mbali gweye kokwima kwa kutogola kwako. Hataivo seke uigodele ila ulole goya. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Manake, yahawa Mulungu hawaonele bazi Wayahudi waja weli kama makwamvi ga mbiki wenyego, baho vuuona kodaha kukuonela bazi gweye? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Lola tanhu Mulungu viyanogile na viyali na ludoko. Iyo kana ludoko kwa waja walekile kumtogola, na kanoga kumwako gweye wahawa kogendelela muunovu wake, kama si ivo nagweye ivija kokanhigwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Nao Wayahudi wahabwelela kumtogola Mulungu, wobandikigwa mdisina kaidi. Kwavija Mulungu kanao udaho wa kuwabandikiza kaidi. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mweye wanhu wa isi zimwenga, vumuli kama kwamvi da mzeituni mbago, mkanhigwa na mbandikizigwa mmizeituni ya mdikonde uja hawili wenu. Mbali Wayahudi wao kama mzeituni mdikonde, yokua mbuli ibuha ng'hani kumwao kubandikizigwa kaidi mumbiki uuja.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulohozi kwa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Walukolo zangu, nonda mvimanye ukweli uno uifisile seke mwize kuiona mna nzewele ng'hani. Udulu wa Wayahudi ukala wa chipindi tu, mbaka wanhu wa isi zimwenga vonda wamtogole Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Baho iyo wanhu wose wa Izilaeli vonda waloholigwe, kama vigalonga Mayandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mlohozi kokwiza kulawila Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">na kuwasegezela ubananzi wose wa waleligwa wa Yakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Dino ijo lagano dinonda kutenda nao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">haja honda niwasegezele malozo gao.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwavija woulema Usenga Unogile, Wayahudi wawa wahasanyi wa Mulungu, mbali kwa kumweda kwenu mweye wanhu wa isi zimwenga. Mbali kwavija wakala wasaguligwe, wang'hali mbwiga wa Mulungu kwambuli ya wasaho zao wa umwaka. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Kama Mulungu yahawabagula wanhu na kuweng'ha gweko jake, hadaha kuhindula mbuli iyo.<verse eid="ROM 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Kama vija mweye wanhu wa isi zimwenga mkala mumleka Mulungu chipindi fulani, mbali sambi mubokela bazi jake kwavija Waizilaeli waleka kumtegeleza. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Kwambuli ya bazi dimubokele mweye, Waizilaeli sambi woleka kumtegeleza Mulungu ili nao ivija wabokele bazi da Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Kwavija wanhu wose hawamtegeleze Mulungu iyo mana kowapeta kama wafungwa, mbali kosang'hana ivo ili yawaonele bazi wose.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu yatogoligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Enaa, Mulungu kana vinhu vingi vinogile, nzewele na umanyi wa Mungu ni mkulu ng'hani! Ulamuzi wake haulolesigwa, habule munhu yonda kuvimanya vija Mulungu viyosang'hana? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Mayandiko golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">“Yelihi yapatile kumanya gayatonga Mndewa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Yelihi yodaha kumlongoza dakulonga?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Hebu yelihi yamwing'ile Mulungu chinhu mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">mbaka yadahe kumbwelezela chinhu icho?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Kwavija vinhu vose volawa kumwake, vose vabaha kwa udaho wake na kwambuli yake. Mulungu yeng'higwe ukulu mazua gose galibule uhelelo. Pepaa!<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Kukala muisang'hano ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kwaivo walukolo zangu, kwavija Mulungu kana bazi kulu, nowapula kwa moyo wose, ilaveni wenyego kumsang'hanila Mulungu, muwe kama nhosa ya Mulungu mwenyego, ija imnogeza Mulungu. Vino ivo vonda msang'hane kwa kumfugamila Mulungu kwa kweli. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Seke mwige viwotenda wanhu wa isi ino, mbali mlekeni Mulungu yawahindule gomgesa ili mtonge gamwenga, baho honda mdahe kuumanya wende wa Mulungu na kuimanya sang'hano inogile, imnogeza na yenele.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwavija kwa unovu ning'higwe na Mulungu nomlongela chila munhu yeli kumwenu, seke yalonde mbuli ng'hulu kubita viilondeka, ila yagese sawa na Mulungu viyamwing'ile chila munhu kuilinga na viyotogola. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Kama vija mulukuli lumwe luna vilungo vingi, chila chimwe china sang'hano yake. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Hata cheye chili wengi, cha lukuli lumwe kwa kuilumba na Kilisito, na chila imwe ni chilungo cha miage. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ivo, Mulungu kaching'ha nhunza hakwehakwe kuilinga na unovu wa Mulungu. Yeng'higwe nhunza ya ulagusi wa Mulungu na yaisang'hanile kuilinga na kutogola kwake. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Yeli na nhunza ya kuhunganikila wamwenga yawahunganikile, hebu nhunza ya kufunda na yafunde, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />kama nhuza ya kugela moyo wamwenga na yasang'hane ivo. Yeli na nhunza ya nying'ha yalave chiyalinacho na yasang'hane ivo kwa moyo mzelu. Mlongozi na yalongoze kwa kuiyoha, na yeng'higwe nhunza ya kuonela bazi wamwenga na yasang'hane ivo kwa ndeng'helelo.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Wende wenu na uwebule dihile jojose. Ihileni mbuli yoyose yaubananzi, sang'haneni gaja ganogile. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Muing'he wende wenyego kwa wenyego mweye mumtogola Kilisito, chila munhu yamwing'he ulongozi miage. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Mgangamale muisang'hano na mgendelele kusang'hana mbuli iyo kwa moyo wose mhamsang'hanila Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Tumanilo jenu dimwing'heni ndeng'helelo, mfunye moyo kwa gaja madununzo na kumpula Mulungu mazua gose. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Watazeni wanhu wayenu wamtogole Kilisito kwa vinhu viwolonda, wabokeleni nyambenyambe kwa nying'ha.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Wapulileni ganogile ga Mulungu waja wowadununza, enaa, wapulileni ganogile ga Mulungu, na hebu sekemuwenukile. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Deng'heleleni hamwe na waja wodeng'helela, lileni hamwe na waja wolila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mkale kwakuilumba goya mweye kwa mweye. Seke muigode mweye mdaha ng'hani, mbali isang'hanileni na waja kina nzakabwa. Seke muigode mweye wa kutogoligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Sekemlihize dihile kwa dihile. Iyoheni kusang'hana gaja wanhu wogamanya kua ganoga. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Kama vija viidahika kwa ubanzi wenu, mkale kwa utindiwala na wanhu wose. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Mbwiga zangu seke mlihize gehile, ila mlekeleni Mulungu mbuli iyo, kwavija Mayandiko ga Mulungu Mndewa kolonga, “Kulihiza gehile ni mbuli yangu, nie iyo nolihiza.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Kaidi yandikigwa, “Mhasanyi wako yahawa na nzala, mwing'he ndia, yahawa na ng'ilu, mwing'he mazi yang'we. Kwavija kwa kutenda ivo kokua kumgela chinyala ng'hani.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Sekeutogole uhumigwe na ubananzi, ila uhume ubananzi kwa ganogile.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kutegeleza vilongozi wa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Chila munhu kolondeka kuwategeleza weli na ulongozi mui silikali, kwavija ulongozi wose wolawa kwa Mulungu, nawo wolongoza wekigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Kwaivo yogalema gaja galagizigwa na vilongozi kogalema malagizo ga Mulungu, nawo wotenda ivo woigalila kulamuligwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Walongozi hawawatenda wanhu watenda goya wadumbe, ila kwa wanhu waja wehile. Ivo kolonda sekeumdumbe yeli na ulongozi? Sang'hana ganogile nayo kokwing'ha nhogolwa, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />kwavija iyo ni msang'hanaji wa Mulungu yosang'hana sang'hano kwambuli yako ubokele ganogile. Mbali wahasang'hana gehile, baho, kolondeka umdumbe, kwavija ni kweli kanao udaho wa kukulamula. Iyo komsang'hanila Mulungu kwa kuwalagusila ludoko lwake waja wosang'hana gehile. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kwaivo kolondeka kuwategeleza weli na ulongozi, sio tu kwavija kodumba ludoko lwa Mulungu, mbali kwavija movimanya kua ivo molondeka kusang'hana.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kwambuli iyo iyo mweye moliha kodi, kwavija vilongozi hao womsang'hanila Mulungu ihawa wosang'hana vija viilondeka. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mwing'heni chila munhu chija chiyalondeka kwing'higwa, munhu yolondeka kwing'higwa kodi, yeng'higwe, na munhu wa kodi, yalihe kodi, na yolondeka kutegelezigwa, yategelezigwe na yolondeka kudumbigwa yadumbigwe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuing'ha wende wenyego kwa wenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Sekemdaigwe na munhu yoyose, ila mdaigwe kwa kuing'ha wende. Yomwing'ha wende miage koitegeleza ndagizi. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Kwavija ndagizi zino zolonga, “Seke utende ugoni, Seke ukome, Seke uwe na maya,” na zimwenga zose zaumo muindagizi imwe, “Mwing'he wende miago kama vuuing'ha gweye mwenyego.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Yomwing'ha wende miage hadaha kumtendela gehile. Kwaivo, wende wogangamiza kuitegeleza ndagizi.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Mweye molondeka kusang'hana gago, kwavija movimanya mwamchipindi gani, sambi icho chipindi cha kulamuka muutulo, enaa, sambi ulohozi wetu wammabehi ng'hani kubita mwanza uja uchisongile kumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Chilo chomala na misi yammabehi. Ivo chizileke mbuli zose zihile za ziza, chivale migoha ya mdibung'hulo. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Nachisang'hane wenyego gaja galondeka kusang'hanigwa ing'hali misi, hebu sio kwa lusona lwa kuja ndia ng'hani na kukoligwa, ugoni na luhadu, kugomba na migongo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Mtonge na kusang'hana kama Mndewa Yesu Kilisito, seke mtogole kulongozigwa na maya zenu zihile.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Seke umulamule miago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mbokeleni miyenu ija yang'hali na nhogola ndodo, mbali sekemgombe nayo kwa gaja goyolonga. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Munhu imwe kotogola kuja chinhu chochose, mbali imwenga yeli na nhogola ndodo koja mboga za mayani ziiyeka. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Munhu yoja chila chinhu seke yamzeleu ija hodaha kuja chila chinhu, nayo yoja mboga za mayani ziiyeka seke yamulamule ija yoja chila chinu, kwavija Mulungu kamtogola. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Gweye kwa nani mbaka umulamule mtumigwa wa imwenga? Mkulu wake iyo yovimanya kama mtumigwa wake kabananga hebu hanabananga, enaa, kokwiza kusang'hana kama viilondeka, kwavija Mndewa kana udaho wa kumtaza yasang'hane viilondeka.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Munhu koona kua zua dimwe dofaya ng'hani kubita zua dimwenga, na munhu imwenga koona kua mazua gose goilinga. Chila imwe na yawinze vija viitonga nzewele yake. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Munhu yotonga kua zua dimwe kulu kumsang'hanila Mulungu kubita zua dimwenga, kotenda ivo kwa kumtogola Mndewa. Nayo yoja ndia yoyose kwambuli ya Mndewa koja kwa komwing'ha hewela Mulungu, nayo yoleka kuja ndia yoyose kwambuli ya Mndewa, nayo ivija komwing'ha hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Habule munhu yoyose mmwenu yokala na ugima kwambuli yake mwenyego, hebu munhu yodanganika kwambuli yake mwenyego. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ivo chihawa wagima chawagima kwambuli ya kumnogeza Mndewa, chahadanganika, chodanganika kwambuli ya kumnogeza Mndewa, Baho, kama chihawa wagima hebu chihadanganika, cheye ni wanhu wake Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Iyo mana Kilisito kadanganika, kazilibuka ili yapate kua Mndewa kwa wanhu weli na ugima na wadanganike. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Gweye koja mboga za mayani ziiyeka habali, komulamula miyago? Nagweye uja chila chinhu habali umzeleu miyago? Cheye chose chokwima haulongozi wa chigoda cha ulamuzi cha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Mayandiko golonga kua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Kweli niye Mulungu nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">chila munhu konitumbalila mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na chila munhu kokwiza kulonga mwenyego kua nie iyo Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kwaivo, chila munhu mmwetu kozilonga mbuli zake ha Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seke umuhonze miago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ivo, chileke kuwalamulana, kaidi sekechiwe ng'walo kwa wayetu hebu kuwahonza wasang'hane malozo. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Kwakuilumba na Mndewa Yesu, kweli novimanya habule chinhu chochose hachitogoligwa kwambuli ya kumfugamila Mulungu kulawa umwaka. Mbali kwaija yochiona hachitogoligwa kumwake, chokua hachitogoligwa kweli kumwake. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ihawa gweye komtenda miago yagwe giogio kwambuli ya ndia yuuja, baho kokua hulongozigwa na wende kwa miago. Seke utogole hata chidogo ndia yako imtende munhu imwenga yage kwavija Kilisito Yesu kadanganika kwambuli yake! <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Baho sekemtogole chinhu mchiona kumwenu kua chinoga chilongigwe vihile. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kwavija ufaume wa Mulungu sio kwambuli ya kuja na kung'wa, mbali ni kusang'hana gaja gotoligwa kua na utindiwala na ndeng'helelo igaligwa na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Mulungu komtogola munhu ija yomsang'hanila Kilisito kwa nzila iyo na ivija kotogoligwa na wanhu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kwaivo chiiyohe ng'hani kusang'hana mbuli zija zigala utindiwala, na gaja gochidahiza kuigela moyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Baho, sekeuibanange sang'hano ya Mulungu kwambuli ya ndia. Ndia zose zotogoligwa, mbali hailondeka kuja ndia ija yomtenda munhu yengile mmalozo. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Yonoga kuleka kuja nyama na kung'wa divai, hebu kusang'hana chochose chija chodaha kumuhonza miago yatende malozo. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Baho, gendelela kutogola vija vuutogola kati yako na Mulungu. Kamweda munhu ija yoiona kua kabule malozo kwambuli ya chija chiyaona kua chikala goya! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Mbali munhu yodumba mmoyo wake kwandia iyoja, kolamuligwa na Mulungu, kwavija kabule kwimila dija diyatogola. Chochose chisang'hanigwa bila kutogola ni malozo.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Watazeni wamwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Cheye chikangale kutogola cholondeka kufunya moyo kwa mbuli ya wayetu weli na nhogola ndodo. Sekechisang'hane mbuli zichitenda chideng'helele wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Chila imwe mmwetu kolondeka kumwing'ha wende miage kwa unovu ili iyo miage yagangamale muinhogoli. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Manake Kilisito hasang'hane mbuli za kumtaza iyo mwenyego, mbali kasang'hana kama Mayandiko viyandikigwe, “Maligo gose gawakuligile gweye gamhata nie.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kwavija, gose gandikigwe mgaMayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa kwambuli ya kuchifunda cheye. Mayandiko gago gochitaza kufunya moyo mgamadununzo na gochigela moyo ili chipate tumanilo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Mulungu iyo yochihoza moyo na kuchitenda chifunyemoyo. Sambi nompula yawadahize mkale kwa kugesa dimwe kwavija moilinga na Kilisito Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ili mweye mose hamwe kwa moyo umwe na dizi dimwe mdahe kumtogola Mulungu, Tata wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Muibokele mweye kwa mweye kama Kilisito viyawabokele ili wanhu wamwing'he nhogola Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Manake, nowalongeleni Kilisito kawasang'hanila Wayahudi yadahe kulagusa kua Mulungu wa kutogoligwa, na gaja malagano gaweng'ile wasaho zetu gavikile, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ili nawo wanhu haweli Wayahudi wadahe kumtogola Mulungu kwambuli ya bazi jake, kama viyandikigwe Mmayandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Kwaivo nokwiza kukutogola hagati mwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Nokwiza kukwimbila nyila za kukutogola kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Ivija zandikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Mweye wanhu haweli Wayahudi deng'heleleni, deng'heleleni hamwe na wanhu wake Mulungu!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Na ivija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mtogoleni Mndewa, mweye wanhu haweli Wayahudi, mweye wanhu wose mtogoleni Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Nayo, Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Kolawila munhu imwe muulelo wa Yese, nayo kowalongoza wanhu wa isi zose, na wanhu haweli Wayahudi, nawo wokwiza kumtumanila.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Baho, Mulungu yeli chanduso cha tumanilo, yawatende mdeng'helele ng'hani na muwe na utindiwala kulawa muinhogola yenu, tumanilo jenu didahe kongezeka kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Walukolo zangu, nie mwenyego nivimanya kweli kua mweye mwa wanovu ng'hani, mna umanyi, na modaha kuigela moyo wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Mbali niwandikila mbuli hakwehakwe muibalua ino, ili kuwakumbusa kwambuli izo. Nhenda ivo kwambuli ya unovu wa Mulungu uyaning'ile <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />unovu wa Mulungu wa kunhenda ie niwe msang'hanaji wa Yesu Kilisito kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi. Nosang'hana kama mlava nhambiko ija yosang'hana kuligula Usenga Unogile wa Mulungu ili wanhu haweli Wayahudi wadahe kua kama nhosa itogoligwa na Mulungu, nhosa ija inang'hanigwe na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Kwaivo, nihawa niilumba na Kilisito Yesu, nodaha kuigodela sang'hano yangu kwambuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Manake sidaha kulonga chinhu chimwenga chochose ila chija tu Kilisito Yesu chiyasang'hane kwakunhumila nie ili wanhu wa isi zimwenga wadahe kumtegeleza Mulungu. Kasang'hana ivo kwa gaja ganilongile na kusang'hana, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa udaho wa kutenda miujza na uzonza, na kwa kusongela Yelusalemu na kae zose zili muimhaka mbaka Iluliko, nimala kuligula Usenga Unogile wa Kilisito vija viilondeka. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Kwambuli iyo, niyoha kuligula Usenga Unogile hohose haja zina da Yesu haditambuligwa, nosang'hana ivo ili seke nibwelele kusang'hana kaidi sang'hano hanhu haja hayasang'hane munhu imwenga. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Wanhu wose waja hawalongeligwe mbuli zake wokwiza kuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">nao waja hawapatile kuzihulika, wokwiza kuzimanya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo koitanda kuita kae ya Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Mbuli iyo ya kuligula Usenga wa Mulungu inikimila mala nyingi kwiza kumwenu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Mbali kwavija sambi ng'omeleza sang'hano yangu mziisi zino, na kwakua milao mingi ng'hala na tamanilo kulu da kwiza kumwenu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />notumanila kwiza kumwenu vinili muumwanza kuita Hisipania. Nokwiza kukala baho Loma kwa chipindi chiguhi. Amala mnhaze kugendelela na mwanza wangu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Mbali, kwa sambi noita kusang'hana sang'hano ya Mulungu kwa wanhu wake kuja Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />kwavija mabumbila ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisito uko Makedonia na Akaya walamula kulava misango yao kuwataza wanhu wa Mulungu weli vikumbi muyega uko Yeluslemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Wao wenyego walamula kusang'hana ivo, mbali kwa kweli iyo ni sang'hano zao kwa mbuli ya wanhu hao wa Yelusalemu. Manake ihawa wanhu wa isi zimwenga wabokela ganogile ga Mulungu, wolondeka nao ivija wawasang'hanile Wayahudi mgaja gawalondeka kubokela mazua gose. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Nihakomeleza sang'hano iyo na kuweng'ha msango uo ukunzanyigwe kwambuli yao, nokwiza kuwatembeleleni mweye nihawa muumwanza kuita Hisipania. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Novimanya kua niheza kumwenu Kilisito kowabalikila ng'hani.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Baho, walukolo zangu, nowapuleni ng'hani kwambuli ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito na kwa wende ugaligwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, muilumbe na nie kwa kunipulila kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Puleni mhate kulawa bila kulumila kwa waja welibule nhogola weli uko Uyahudi, nayo sang'hano yangu uko Yelusalemu ipate kutogoligwa na wanhu wa Mulungu weli uko. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ivo, Mulungu yahalonda, nodaha kwiza kumwenu na moyo wa deng'helelo, na kuilegeha hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nompula Mulungu yogala utindiwala yakale na mweye mose! Pepaa!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kolamusa wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Baho, nonda mvimanye kua modaha kumtogola lumbu jetu Foibe, yeli msang'hanaji mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito weli muikae ya Kenikilea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mbokeleni kwambuli ya Mndewa kama viilondigwa kuwabokela wanhu wa Mulungu. Mtazeni vovose viyolonda kulawa kumwenu, manake munhu iyo kawataza wanhu wengi na kumwangu ivija.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ndamusileni kina Pilisila na Akila mulumeake, wasang'hanaji wayangu muisang'hano ya Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Wanhu wao watogola hata wauhonza ugima wao kwambuli yangu. Wolondeka weng'higwe hewela, sio kulawa kumwangu tu, mbali ivija kulawa kwa mabumbila gose ga wamtogole Kilisito ga wanhu haweli Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Nowalamsa ivija bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Kilisito diwaiting'hanila ukae kwa Pilisila na Akila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Mlamseni ivija mbwigaangu ng'hani Epaineto yakalile wa mosi muiisi ya Asia kumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Mlamseni na Malia yasang'hane sang'hano kwakuiyoha kwambuli yenu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Walamuseni Anduloniko na Yunia, wenekae wayangu wafungigwe mdigeleza hamwe na nie, nao watumigwa wa Mulungu wawamanya ng'hani, kaidi wao wanilongolela kumtogola Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Ndamusileni Ampiliato, mbwigaangu kwa kuilumba na Mndewa.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ndamusileni Ulubano, msang'hanaji miangu muisang'hano ya Kilisito, nomlamsa ivija na mbwigaangu Sitaku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ndamusileni Apele ija yalaguse katogoligwa na Kilisito. Ndamusileni wose weli muing'anda ya Alisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ndamusileni Helodiani, Muyahudi miangu, na kwa wanhu wose weli muing'anda Nalikiso womtogola Mndewa.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ndamusileni Tulufena na Tilifosa wanachike wasang'hanaji sang'hano kwa kuiyoha kwambuli ya Mndewa Yesu Kilisito. Mlamseni mbwigaangu Pelisisi mwanachike imwenga yasang'hane sang'hano ng'hani kwambuli ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ndamusileni Lufo, yasaguligwe na Mndewa na ndamusileni mama yake kama mama yangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ndamusileni Asunikilito na Fulegoni na Helime na Patoloba na Helima na walukolo wose weli hamwe nao.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ndamusileni Filologo na Yulia na Nelea na lumbu jake, mlamuseni Olimipa hamwe na wanhu wose wa Mulungu weli hamwe nao.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ilamseni wenyego kwa wenyego kwa chilaguso cha kulagusa kua mnawende. Molamusigwa na wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisito weli kuno.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kokomeleza malagizo gano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Walukolo wangu, nompulani ng'hani muwalole goya na wanhu wose wogala ndwagi na kuwatenda wanhu wamwenga kuleka mafundo gamfundigwe. Muinege nao! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Kwavija wanhu wosang'hana ivo hawamsang'hanila Kilisito Mndewa wetu, mbali wozisang'hanila zinda zao wenyego. Kwaulonzi wao unogile na mbuli zinogile za kuswangiza wanhu na kuwagiza wanhu waja hawamanyile ubananzi. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Chila munhu kahulika kutegeleza kwenu nanie ndeng'helela ng'hani kwambuli yenu, nolonda muwe na nzewele kwa mbuli zinogile naseke mulaumigwe kwambuli zihile. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Nayo Mulungu yeli mgala utindiwala hakawila kumhonda Mwenembago na kuweng'ha mweye ludabwa lwa kumuhuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:20">Unovu wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ukale na mweye<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteo, msang'hanaji miangu komlamseni. Ivija Wayahudi wayangu Lukio na Yasoni na Sosipateli, womlamseni.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nie Telitio inyandika balua ino kama viyanilongele Paulo, nomlamseni kwa zina da Mndewa.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Nie Paulo, Gayo ija mwenekae wangu, hamwe na bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito doiting'hana hamwake, kowalamseni. Elasto, mgoga sente wa kae ino, hamwe na Kwalito, komlamseni.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Nowapulila unovu wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ukale na mweye mose. Pepaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo komwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Ivo, sambi na chimwing'he hewela Mulungu! Iyo kodaha kuwagangamizeni kwa kutogola Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisito kama vija vinikalile nouligula kumwenu. Umwaka mbuli izo zikala zifisigwe, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />mbali sambi ukweli uwikigwa hazelu kubitila Mayandiko ga walagusi wa Mulungu, zimanyika na wanhu wa isi zose kama viyalagize Mulungu yelibule uhelelo ili wadahe kumtogola na kumtegeleza Mndewa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Mulungu yeli yaiyeka, yeli na nzewele zose, ija yotogologwa kwa nzila ya Yesu Kilisito, ukulu ni wake mazua gose galibule uhelelo! Pepaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>